00:23:59.100 --> 00:24:01.380
We had a fan question from Colleen S.

502
00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.120
in Chicago who said,

503
00:24:03.320 --> 00:24:06.060
Do you have any stories behind Pam's painting clothes?

