00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:10.700
The outfit was auctioned off after the series ended and I ended up winning it.

505
00:24:11.060 --> 00:24:14.660
Jenna, if you would like to have it back, I would be more than happy to send it to you.

506
00:24:15.200 --> 00:24:16.900
Colleen, I have to tell you something.

507
00:24:17.380 --> 00:24:18.620
I have one too.

508
00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:20.440
