511
00:24:27.480 --> 00:24:31.380
So I have one of the sweatshirts and you must have the other one.

512
00:24:31.660 --> 00:24:34.880
So I have one of the Pratt sweatshirts with all the paint on it.

513
00:24:34.940 --> 00:24:39.360
And this was just the idea of Alicia Raycraft, our costume designer.

514
00:24:39.360 --> 00:24:42.700
She came and she said, What do you think Pam's painting clothes are?

515
00:24:42.780 --> 00:24:43.860
And she had this idea.

516
00:24:43.860 --> 00:24:47.600
And I loved this callback to her time at Pratt.

517
00:24:47.740 --> 00:24:49.400
I just absolutely loved it.

518
00:24:49.640 --> 00:24:50.500
So creative.

519
00:24:50.880 --> 00:24:53.000
It also looks like a very cozy sweatshirt.

520
00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:54.320
Oh, I loved this outfit.

521
00:24:54.520 --> 00:24:54.940
I bet.

522
00:24:55.140 --> 00:24:56.040
You got to wear jeans.

523
00:24:56.340 --> 00:24:56.660
Jeans.

524
00:24:56.820 --> 00:24:58.960
I can't believe you wore pantyhose for nine years.

525
00:24:59.100 --> 00:24:59.340
I know.

526
00:25:00.240 --> 00:25:01.820
I didn't wear them one day.

527
