While he wasn't there.

537
00:25:29.020 --> 00:25:29.200
Yeah.

538
00:25:29.360 --> 00:25:31.660
He was like, I could have prevented that if I had been there.

539
00:25:31.980 --> 00:25:32.220
Yep.

540
00:25:32.220 --> 00:25:34.000
I guess Jim doesn't like the name.

541
00:25:34.200 --> 00:25:35.340
I like Athlete.

542
00:25:35.440 --> 00:25:35.800
I don't.

543
00:25:35.860 --> 00:25:36.700
I think it's terrible.

544
00:25:36.820 --> 00:25:37.240
Oh, really?

545
00:25:38.100 --> 00:25:42.160
It's like so, it's so well chosen that it's a bad name.

546
00:25:42.680 --> 00:25:44.480
It's hard to say Athlete.

547
00:25:44.840 --> 00:25:45.640
I don't like it.

548
00:25:45.860 --> 00:25:46.080
Athlete.

549
00:25:46.140 --> 00:25:48.080
Sounds like athlete's foot to me.

550
00:25:48.280 --> 00:25:48.800
I don't know.

551
00:25:48.940 --> 00:25:49.620
